{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:12.40.030","page_type":"section"},"citation":"12.40.030","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.40.030","content_hash":"6cf424e5fcefd5a173abed3b8fa9c9c899c6bdc04ee73d017f2528ee1362c8fd","heading":"Notice of violations.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.40.030:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.40.030","text":"(a) The notice of violation shall state the following information:\n(1) The section of this chapter allegedly violated;\n(2) The name and address of the owner of the property where alleged violations occurred;\n(3) The location, date and time of the alleged violation;\n(4) The applicable administrative monetary penalty;\n(5) The fee which shall be automatically assessed for late payment;\n(6) The payment of the indicated administrative monetary penalty and any applicable late fee shall operate as a final disposition of the violation;\n(7) Information about the availability of the administrative appeal procedure; and\n(8) Information about the availability of the snow relief team or other available local assistance.\n(b) The Public Works Director or his or her designee shall compile and maintain complete and accurate records relating to all violations of this chapter and the dispositions thereof. (Ord. 19570 § 3, 5-24-11.)\nCross References: Public Works Department, TMC 2.20.100 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"46174194-9b00-5be4-93d4-70b26c54ec22"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.40.030","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.40.030","content_hash":"3a47c1d130ec82da3580732a4546aa8a188c94ae9ed96cbfb926c4a24f42fe49","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"